Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi! Shuichi! Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi! Shuichi! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.95,0:00:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi! Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Clair. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Why are you inside of Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To... kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.83,0:03:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible. Your only sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...? Why did you kill Mom and Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you watch the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The police said it was an accident with the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it'd be bad seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you had\Nto bring this up in front of Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.45,0:03:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They were bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They were always so strict with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"Get your act together,\Nour family has an image to uphold."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad was a legislator,\Nbut he did bad things behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom had an affair with one of\Nthe young employees at her company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you said it:\N"I'm going to kill them one day."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So I did it. For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no longer the weak sister you knew,\Nthe one you had to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm strong now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still have the coin I gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you another one, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it to the abandoned\Nmotel along the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Clair. Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Make good use of the coin, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry it ended this way, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nn...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die, Clair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.91,0:06:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm not sure that\Nthis qualifies as "alive," but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't die too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your promise...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be worried\Nabout others when you're like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair! I can't brea--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hotel Mythos"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Running Spirit"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that looks like it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:06:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!\NYou should have told me you had a coin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Clair. This guy knows about the coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you fix him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't know until I take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Try anything funny, and you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. I can fix him. He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, hand over the coin please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.79,0:07:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This? I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the coin to fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure you can fix Shuichi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! Drink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit hard to explain...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of controlling microbes\Nwith molecular mechanisms...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about the theory.\NIf he drinks it, his neck will reattach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll you do, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd gone back to your normal form\Nin that state, you would have died!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, hold it down tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, it might stick on crooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it okay if I get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shuichi. You mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.29,0:09:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oooh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you just have a surprisingly lovely body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too. You're pretty handsome, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This body?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've simply adopted the most\Nsuitable one for fitting in on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't actually have static forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.45,0:09:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Haven't you heard?\NI'm what you people call an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?\N--Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally thought someone\Ntold you before you came!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be sure to keep my personal\Ninformation private, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.79,0:10:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I am certainly an alien,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but physically speaking,\NI'm a complete human male, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, might I touch them just--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry! Reflex!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please trust me! I'm not a bad alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! I'll demonstrate.\NYour name is Clair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give me one of\Nyour hairs from down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They haven't started growing yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A lie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving a single hair off\Nmy head to someone I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just used the one\NI snatched when you kicked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Question: Do you like yourself?\NOr do you hate yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pointless question.\NYou don't get to choose who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still can't find anything\Nat all to like about yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You should just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Some people wish they\Nwere someone else, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it could happen to just about anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from people that are\Nreally into themselves, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever think...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...you'd like to turn into someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the slightest bit intrigued?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:12:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The prospect of becoming\Nthe person you've wanted to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A greater version of your current self.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body really is quite nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll stick with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the slightest bit intrigued?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A new and different version of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can change your life in ways\Nthat will surely be... interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like your friend there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he the one that made me this way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you change Shuichi into a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.79,0:12:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With medicine. Similar to the one he just drank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, calling him a monster is a little rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the form he desired--his ideal form!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:13:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The medicine works by changing\Nthe body as its owner desires, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.87,0:13:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I never wanted to turn into this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and I certainly don't\Nremember drinking that medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who made you take that form.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What an incredible idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting someone inside of you\Nto make up for your own weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.62,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans really are more\Nimaginative than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're\Nthe source of all this trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept the fact that you're an alien...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...but I'd like you to drop that appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're freely revealing my...\Npersonal information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a shame. I really liked this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be okay for you to transform back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Cla--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Clair... What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We were on the way back to our home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Physical forms become a nuisance\Nduring long trips through space,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so we compressed our minds\Nand knowledge into data.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what those coins are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,However, our spaceship\Nwore down and eventually broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We ended up crashing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My brethren were flung\Nfrom the ship and spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Repairing the ship and finding my friends\Nare outside of my realm of expertise,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'd like you to join the ranks of "gatherers"\Nthat are looking for my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, you'll be compensated.\NWe'll start with a single coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.16,0:15:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, I give you medicine\Nthat lets you transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you collect 100 coins,\Nyou can do something even more amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like comic books?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Comic books?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cartoons or movies are good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really entertaining, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been hooked on them since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning into a giant and\Ndefeating a whole city of enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,using your own energy to destroy\Na planet--they can do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be cool if you could\Nturn into something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi. Have you ever\Npicked up one of those coins before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:16:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi has no memory\Nof how he became a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone probably made him drink it\Nor something--you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Might involve a girl two years older\Nthan me with communication problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is there really a\Nbad person like that out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, whether or not\Nyou participate is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.95,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The coin...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.87,0:16:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for power, you lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky I found these sandals!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know my sister at all then, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the same year in school as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but she's always gone to\Nprivate schools in other areas,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so it'll be hard to find out\Nwhat your connection is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That bitch did it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how,\Nbut she took that medicine and--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Clair, no!\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't use the coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You have another, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Things keep getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've almost been killed twice\Nin the past two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're unable to transform.\NIf this keeps up--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are much better for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Way better than before\Nmy sister killed our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... The worst of it was\Njust after my sister disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I told people what happened,\Nbut nobody believed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no place for me in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But that all changed when I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My life seemed to start up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:18:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And I found a place in it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really incredible!\NThere's an alien that gives you crazy powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,plus my sister is all wrapped up in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I won't use the coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair and I are really are completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, that's so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where the hell do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you... so strong...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kagaya! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Abukawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:18:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are your glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I switched to contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagaya feels a bit different lately, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he just seems more adult or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Mifune?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? How did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you coming up the stairs a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give your notebook back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the girls in our class was\Nsaying how you're kind of cool now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your glasses weren't so bad, tho--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mifune...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you do if\Nthe world was going to end today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, is this one of those
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.29,0:20:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"what would you take to\Na deserted island" questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What if there was someone\Nwho didn't care about other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and that person became incredibly powerful...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So powerful that they could destroy\Nthis town, or the entire planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The world could end out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With no warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If something like that could happen today...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Well... I don't know,\Nthat sounds tricky...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I... I guess, for me,\NI'd be worried about my parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and all my classmates...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd try to stop the bad guy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,or do my best to make sure that didn't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's normal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I needed to hear someone say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just speculating,\Nbut it's hard to imagine that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.37,0:21:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,everything the alien said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some big story lurking\Nin the shadows of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm pretty sure I'm not the main character.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The spaceship went down\Nsomewhere in those mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good chance we'll find some coins,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but also a good chance\Nwe'll run into some enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Shuichi. You'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:21:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.33,0:22:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 5: Crazy Enemies"
